    "text": "100.7 KOOL FM\nwebsite\nFort Worth\nBuc-ee’s Halloween Gear Is Here\nBy Dan Patrick,\n11 hours agoI had a chance to stop by the Madisonville Buc-ee's this week, and they had already put out all their Halloween gear. I was so psyched to see this was the year of the witch. Buc-ee is wearing a purple witch costume in all of the merchandise. In years past, he was a vampire and other classic Halloween characters, but the witch costume is a slam dunk.\n1",
